<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5760] Support matching model exactly for list jobs</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5760</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Description&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Description&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At present the API of list jobs (/kylin/api/jobs) will return all job lists that fuzzy match the given key. Sometimes, for better performance, the key is applied to match jobs exactly, however, it&apos;s not supported yet.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13573331">KYLIN-5760</key>
            <summary>Support matching model exactly for list jobs</summary>
