                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17831129" author="JIRAUSER294653" created="Wed, 27 Mar 2024 02:00:23 +0000"  >&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Design&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Design&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Add a parameter &lt;em&gt;&apos;exact&apos; to control whether match job list exactly. By default is false to keep previous behavior. If it&apos;s true, then match all jobs of the given model name(case insensitive).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#36820;&#22238;&#20219;&#21153;&#21015;&#34920;: &lt;tt&gt;GET &lt;a href=&quot;http://host:port/kylin/api/jobs&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://host:port/kylin/api/jobs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/tt&gt;{&lt;tt&gt;}&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
